# QA (M1 Stage 1): a relaxed, curious, imperfect full run at walking speed
# (handwritten, no solver prefix). Busbahnhof: walks under the box row,
# bumps the ?-box from below, climbs onto the brick row and walks over its
# Oblaten, steps. Mirabellgarten: jumps over tourist #1 while it takes a
# selfie, bumps the M-box, eats the Mozartkugel after the hedge wall turns it
# back (PowerUp), stomps tourist #2 on the walled hedge top (D-038), breaks
# two planter bricks from below as Zuckerschock (tourist #3 knocked out),
# climbs the Pegasus basin and plinth for the Oblaten arc, stomps tourist #4
# in the Zwergerl trench. Makartsteg: stomps Taube #1 over the deck, walking
# jumps over the four gaps. Getreidegasse: past the checkpoint, back to bump
# the M-box at col 132 as Zuckerschock (points only), stomps a tourist, up
# onto Z1, a running jump enters the Erker from the side under the burger sign
# (one-way) and jumps back out onto the sign, a normal jump from the sign
# (headroom since D-038) onto Z3, Z4, stomps Verkaeufer #1, walks under the
# stand. Domplatz: hides on the Residenzbrunnen top while the Fiaker charges
# through, gets hit by the stage tourist (Hurt: back to Normal), jumps onto the
# Jedermann stage and lets the flying Taube pass over her, waits under the
# grandstand for the risen Sphaera Taube to pass (D-038 stagger), over the
# Sphaera onto the car, rides up and takes a running jump to the Wurstkranz
# (5000). 60 of 81 Oblaten, 4158 frames (69 s).
